  "titleEn": "The Past Tense",
  "grammarTip": "The perfekt (past tense) is formed with the present tense of 'biti' (to be) plus the l-participle of the main verb, which changes for gender: masculine ends in -o, feminine in -la. 'Raditi' (to work) → (ja) radio sam / radila sam (I worked); 'ići' (to go) → išao sam / išla sam; 'vidjeti' (to see) → vidio sam / vidjela sam. In speech the auxiliary 'sam' usually comes right after the participle: Jučer sam radio. Prošle sedmice sam putovao u Sarajevo.",
